      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The E15 error code on a Bosch dishwasher typically indicates a drainage issue, faulty water discharge valve, or a clogged filter and pump. Before attempting complex repairs, ensure the sink drain below the dishwasher is not obstructed, as this is the most common cause. You can often resolve the issue by thoroughly cleaning the filter and checking the discharge pump for debris, followed by a full manual drain to clear any stuck water. If the problem persists after these steps, you may need to inspect the water discharge valve or consult a professional technician for further diagnosis.",
