      "role": "user",
      "content": "so i tilted it and i found a bunch of water in the bottom tray, but im kinda worried. i tried drying it with a towel and a hair dryer, but every time i start a new cycle it comes right back after like 5 minutes. is there something i'm missing or is there like a hidden leak i can't see?",
